extends /layouts/main

block content
  main.container.py-5
    .d-flex.justify-content-between.align-items-center.mb-4
      div
        h1.h3.fw-bold.mb-1 Mis colecciones
        p.text-muted.mb-0 Tus publicaciones guardadas.

    if collections.length
      .row.g-3
        each collection in collections
          .col-12.col-md-6.col-lg-4
            a.text-decoration-none(
              href=`/collections/${collection.id}`
            )
              .card.border-0.shadow-sm.rounded-4.h-100
                .card-body.p-4
                  .d-flex.align-items-center.gap-3
                    .rounded-circle.bg-light.d-flex.align-items-center.justify-content-center(
                      style="width:48px;height:48px;"
                    )
                      i.bi.bi-folder.fs-4.text-dark

                    div
                      h2.h6.fw-bold.text-dark.mb-1= collection.name
                      small.text-muted
                        | #{collection.Posts.length} publicaciones

    else
      .card.border-0.shadow-sm.rounded-4
        .card-body.text-center.p-5
          i.bi.bi-folder.fs-1.text-muted
          h2.h5.mt-3 Todavía no tenés colecciones
          p.text-muted.mb-0
            | Guardá una publicación para crear tu primera colección.